dɪsˈmæntḷ","v.","瓦解；拆除"]],"S":[{"a":0,"h":"第 1 段","p":[["@Cross-Border Human Trafficking Ring Busted: Organ Harvesting Plot Foiled","破獲跨國人口販運集團：活摘器官陰謀遭瓦解"],["Taiwanese [prosecutors|1] and police have [dismantled|2] a [ruthless|3] [human trafficking|4] [syndicate|5] that lured [unsuspecting|6] job [seekers|7] with [false|8] [promises|9], [intending to|10] [smuggle|11] them to China for [forced|12] organ harvesting.","台灣檢警聯手破獲了一個殘暴的人口販運集團。該犯罪集團以求職陷阱誘騙毫無戒心的求職者，企圖將他們偷渡至中國進行強制活摘器官。"],["The Taoyuan District Prosecutors Office recently [concluded|13] its [investigation|14], [indicting|15] seven core [ringleaders|16] and [recommending|17] a heavy seven-year prison sentence for each [suspect|18] [under charges of|19] [organized crime|20], human trafficking, and [attempted|21] organ harvesting.","桃園地檢署近日偵查終結，起訴七名核心主謀，並依組織犯罪、人口販運及意圖摘取人體器官等罪嫌，具體求處每名嫌犯七年有期徒刑的重刑。"]]},{"a":1,"h":"第 2 段","p":[["According to [law enforcement|22], the [syndicate|23] was [spearheaded|24] by two cousins who [collaborated|25] with an overseas buyer [code-named|26] \"Mountain Water\" (山水).","執法單位指出，該集團由一對堂兄弟（或表兄弟）主導，兩人與代號「山水」的境外買家勾結聯手。"],["To [recruit|27] victims, the [gang|28] recruited three teenagers to [infiltrate|29] high school [campuses|30] and social media [communities|31].","為了招攬受害者，該集團吸收了三名青少年潛入高中校園和社群網路平台。"]]},{"a":2,"h":"第 3 段","p":[["Using platforms such as Facebook and Telegram, the [recruiters|32] posted [deceptive|33] [advertisements|34] offering [lucrative|35] [wages|36] for [bank fraud|37] [couriers|38] or port [smugglers|39].","招募人員利用 Facebook 及 Telegram 等管道刊登詐騙廣告，開出優渥報酬招募銀行人頭帳戶車手或港口走私人員。"],["For every individual [successfully|40] [transported|41] abroad to have their organs harvested, the syndicate stood to earn between 100,000 and 300,000 Tether (USDT) — amounting to roughly NT$3.2 million to NT$9.6 million.","每成功將一人送往境外進行活摘器官，該集團便可獲利 10 萬至 30 萬枚泰達幣（USDT），折合新台幣約 320 萬至 960 萬元。"],["[Digital|42] [forensic|43] [analysis|44] of [seized|45] mobile phones [uncovered|46] [cold-blooded|47] [discussions|48] on [encrypted|49] messaging apps.","對查扣手機進行的數位鑑識分析顯示，加密通訊軟體內充斥著冷血殘酷的對話紀錄。"]]},{"a":3,"h":"第 4 段","p":[["Members [callously|50] referred to [human beings|51] as [livestock|52], [gloating|53] that [profits|54] from organ harvesting would soon [afford|55] them luxury Italian sports cars and [prime|56] [real estate|57].","集團成員泯滅人性地將活人蔑稱為「牲畜」，並沾沾自喜地炫耀活摘器官牟取的暴利很快就能讓他們買下義大利頂級超跑與黃金地段豪宅。"],["The group [outlined|58] [chilling|59] [abduction|60] plans, [conspiring|61] to [lure|62] targets to [secluded|63] fishing ports without [surveillance|64] cameras, [stun|65] them with [tasers|66], force them into [vehicles|67], and smuggle them onto waiting vessels [bound for|68] China.","該犯罪集團還擬定了令人不寒而慄的綁架計畫，密謀將目標誘騙至沒有監視器的偏僻漁港，以電擊槍將其擊暈後強押上車，再走私運上預先等候、開往中國的船隻。"]]},{"a":4,"h":"第 5 段","p":[["[Fortunately|69], the syndicate's plots [unravelled|70] before any victims could be taken out of the country. The first victim, [identified as|71] A1, [responded to|72] a [fraudulent|73] job offer in mid-August 2025 and was immediately [confined|74] in a [residential|75] apartment.","所幸，在任何受害者被運送出境之前，該集團的陰謀便已破局。首名代號為 A1 的受害者於 2025 年 8 月中旬落入求職詐騙陷阱，隨即遭拘禁在一般公寓住宅內。"],["However, a [severe|76] typhoon struck Taiwan, [shutting down|77] all [maritime|78] [transport|79] and [halting|80] the smuggling route. In the ensuing delay, internal leaks sparked panic among the criminals, prompting them to release A1 after two days of [captivity|81].","然而，一場強烈颱風隨後侵襲台灣，導致所有海上航運全面停擺，走私路線被迫中斷。在行程延誤期間，組織內部走漏風聲引發嫌犯恐慌，最終迫使他們在囚禁 A1 兩天後將其釋放。"]]},{"a":5,"h":"第 6 段","p":[["[Subsequent|82] attempts to [ensnare|83] two additional victims, A2 and A3, also failed when both individuals grew [suspicious|84] during [initial|85] meetings and [swiftly|86] [fled the scene|87].","隨後企圖誘捕另外兩名受害者（代號 A2 與 A3）的行動也宣告失敗，兩人在初次見面時便察覺有異，隨即迅速逃離現場。"],["Following [extensive|88] [surveillance|89] and two waves of raids, [authorities|90] [detained|91] the [primary|92] suspects and [dismantled|93] the ring, ensuring that none of the targeted victims were smuggled overseas.","歷經密集的跟監蒐證以及兩波攻堅搜索行動，執法機關成功將主要嫌犯拘捕到案並瓦解該犯罪集團，確保了所有鎖定的受害目標均未被走私出境。"]]}],"K":[[[[0.26,0],[1.04,0.158],[1.62,0.27],[2.29,0.428],[2.79,0.492],[3.95,0.603],[4.46,0.714],[5.56,0.872],[5.9,0.936],[6.06,1]],[[7.83,0],[8.51,0.051],[9.5,0.118],[9.85,0.139],[10.16,0.175],[10.64,0.196],[10.94,0.232],[11.41,0.252],[11.79,0.289],[12.36,0.325],[12.97,0.376],[13.66,0.427],[14.14,0.448],[14.43,0.469],[15.36,0.536],[15.6,0.556],[16.15,0.592],[16.39,0.613],[16.54,0.634],[17.58,0.685],[18.2,0.737],[18.46,0.757],[18.72,0.794],[19.07,0.814],[19.19,0.835],[19.96,0.871],[20.2,0.892],[20.55,0.913],[20.93,0.949],[21.63,1]],[[23.53,0],[23.68,0.016],[24.01,0.032],[24.55,0.059],[25.18,0.111],[25.67,0.138],[26.43,0.178],[27.07,0.217],[27.19,0.233],[28.49,0.296],[29.13,0.336],[29.56,0.363],[29.95,0.379],[30.49,0.419],[31.01,0.435],[31.97,0.486],[32.19,0.502],[32.59,0.529],[33.23,0.569],[33.84,0.597],[34.28,0.624],[34.52,0.64],[34.7,0.656],[35.23,0.684],[35.79,0.711],[36.23,0.739],[36.42,0.755],[37.11,0.794],[37.75,0.81],[38.07,0.838],[39.01,0.878],[39.23,0.893],[39.79,0.933],[40.17,0.961],[40.72,1]]],[[[0.26,0],[0.95,0.069],[1.11,0.097],[1.44,0.125],[2.46,0.215],[2.74,0.243],[3.59,0.312],[3.79,0.34],[4.51,0.41],[4.78,0.437],[5.24,0.465],[5.8,0.514],[6.24,0.542],[7.3,0.653],[7.57,0.68],[7.78,0.708],[8.56,0.778],[8.92,0.806],[9.24,0.854],[9.74,0.903],[10.22,0.951],[10.78,1]],[[11.88,0],[12.16,0.036],[12.67,0.097],[13.39,0.159],[13.6,0.195],[13.94,0.231],[14.7,0.319],[14.96,0.354],[15.73,0.443],[16.03,0.478],[16.65,0.567],[17.06,0.602],[17.14,0.638],[17.87,0.726],[18.31,0.762],[18.63,0.823],[19.3,0.885],[20.14,1]]],[[[0.31,0],[0.81,0.045],[1.53,0.091],[1.84,0.117],[2.16,0.143],[2.97,0.208],[3.21,0.234],[4.31,0.299],[4.61,0.325],[5.15,0.39],[5.67,0.435],[6.44,0.5],[7.66,0.603],[8.45,0.668],[9.24,0.733],[9.64,0.779],[9.99,0.805],[10.29,0.831],[10.62,0.857],[11.06,0.902],[11.36,0.928],[11.65,0.955],[12.28,1]],[[13.06,0],[13.28,0.016],[13.84,0.057],[14.72,0.11],[15.49,0.1